Hi <%= @user.first_name %>,

An event has been assigned to you in the Netball America database.

Event: <%= @event.name %>
Type: <%= @event.event_type %>
Date: <%= @event.date.present? ? @event.date.to_fs(:long) : "To be confirmed" %>
<% if @event.end_date.present? %>End date: <%= @event.end_date.to_fs(:long) %>
<% end %><% if @event.location.present? || @event.city.present? || @event.state.present? %>Location: <%= [@event.location, @event.city, @event.state].compact_blank.join(", ") %>
<% end %>
View event: <%= event_url(@event) %>

Regards,
Netball America
